      "prompt": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "A group of students purchase ice cream cones and ice cream sundaes. The cones cost \\$1.40 each,\nand the cost for 19 sundaes is \\$64.60. The total cost for the cones and sundaes is\\$85. 60. Which\nequation represents this situation, where $x$ is the number of cones purchased and $y$ is the number\nof sundaes purchased?"
